stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> blank : POST /api/agent/generate → article created

  blank --> generating : job status = running
  generating --> draft : job status = done (body written)
  generating --> error : job status = error

  draft --> draft : PATCH /api/articles/{id} (autosave)
  draft --> draft : POST /api/agent/regenerate (body rewritten)
  draft --> inspecting : POST /api/articles/{id}/inspect

  inspecting --> draft : gate = pass | warn (inspection complete)
  inspecting --> draft : gate = fail (inspection complete)

  draft --> pushing : POST /api/articles/{id}/push
  pushing --> draft : push job done (destinations updated)
  pushing --> draft : push job error (destination.status = error)

  error --> [*] : DELETE /api/articles
  draft --> [*] : DELETE /api/articles